  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLet '*' be '×'\n\nLet '#' and '@' be '+'\n\nSo,\n\n40 * 30 # 20 @ 10 = 1230\n\n__**40 × 30**__ + 20 + 10 = 1230\n\n__**1200 + 20 + 10**__ = 1230\n\n1230 = 1230 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n70 * 6 # 10 @ 3 = 433\n\n__70 × 6__ + 10 + 3 = 433\n\n__420 + 10 + 3__ = 433\n\n433 = 433 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n8 * 4 # 5 @ 9 = ?\n\n__8 × 4__ + 5 + 9 = ?\n\n__32 + 5 + 9__ = ?\n\n**46** **= ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
